# BossMind Connected Responsive PWA Apps Pack

This pack contains 5 installable apps already wired to the shared BossMind `/api/chat` route.

## Included apps
1. Resumora
2. ElegancyArt Builder
3. AI Video Generator
4. TikTok AI
5. Global Stock

## What is already connected
- Shared BossMind chat client
- Project key per app
- Enter-to-send chat
- Auto / Brain / Worker / Background modes
- Saved API base URL in browser local storage
- Responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- PWA install support

## How to use
1. Host these files on any static host.
2. Open one app.
3. Enter your BossMind backend base URL once.
4. Press Enter to send requests to `/api/chat`.

## Important
This pack is pre-wired, but it cannot deploy itself into your local machine, GitHub, Railway, or Render without access to those systems.
